cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
message: "If you use mcp-context-card, please cite it as below."
title: "mcp-context-card — an MCP server for discoverable project context, memory, and identity"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server that publishes a project's AGENTS.md,
  cross-session memory, and agent identity through two mechanisms already in the
  ecosystem: the Server Card _meta block and ai-catalog.json sibling entries.
